Proper subgroups from an invariant row space
============================================

This note records the elementary linear criterion requested by Root for
the existing F004 intake. It is not a new classification theorem. The
earlier retained verify.py (9f0fa443...) already contains the same
invariant-space strategy, using a supplied separating covector. Here a
rectangular right inverse supplies the membership test instead. Root
proposed this particular certificate for the 24 recorded lower-span
